From 8e2e97cf946463fa875bf8e9005057fe83d0feb8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 13:47:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] chore(supabase): adim 1b fonksiyon ikizleri teshis SQL'i

Adim 1 sonucu checkout RPC'lerinin hem public hem private semasinda
durdugunu gosterdi. Bu sorgu public kopyalarin wrapper mi yoksa
bagimsiz implementasyon mu oldugunu ve migration defterinin tam
icerigini cikarir.

Yerel PostgreSQL 16 fixture'inda ON_ERROR_STOP=1 ile dogrulandi.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018qx6EK82bwAMKTdEpeH25Z
---
